---
// "Free website audit" box shown at the end of every blog post. Links to /free-audit.
---
<aside class="audit" aria-labelledby="audit-cta-title">
  <span class="label">Free website audit</span>
  <h2 id="audit-cta-title">Wondering how your own site measures up?</h2>
  <p>Send me your URL and I'll review it against everything in posts like this one, then email you your top 3 fixes. Free, and no call required.</p>
  <a href="/free-audit" class="btn">Get my free audit</a>
</aside>

<style>
  .audit { margin-top: 48px; background: var(--magenta-soft); border-left: 6px solid var(--magenta); border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px 32px; }
  .label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--magenta-dark); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: .4em; }
  p { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .audit { padding: 24px 20px; } }
</style>
